<title>ALGERIA: Second blast rocks Algiers after bomb kills seven.</title>
<headline>Second blast rocks Algiers after bomb kills seven.</headline>
<dateline>ALGIERS 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A second explosion shook Algiers on Monday, less than three hours after a bomb killed at least seven people and wounded 37 in the Algerian capital.</p>
<p>Foreign journalists, in the city to cover Thursday's parliamentary elections, said the blast at 11.20 a.m. (1020 GMT) appeared to come from the western part of the city's downtown area. No details were immediately available.</p>
